#   Description		: Share Investment account id is inserted into custom table
#					: and this SRV is Used to insert the previous outstanding loan accounts into LADISB_PAYOFF_OLDLOAN custom table
#   Date			: 08-07-2013
#   Author			: Bharath Reddy
#   Input			: NA
#   Output			: NA
#   Called Script	:
#   Calling Script	: s_laadisbmn009.scr,s_ast0057mn004.scr
